Mosaic shells out to the system ffprobe binary for media indexing and
probing, and to the system ffmpeg binary for transcoding. Neither is
distributed with mosaic; the user installs them, and the documented route is
conda-forge. A redistributor who bundles an ffmpeg build must observe that
build's terms, which depend on how it was configured.

